// =============================================================================
// Fenn Wildmane — Stablemaster / Pet Trainer.  Questline: "Wild Hearts" (vendor.stable)
// Keystone: the Bonded Beast.  Teaches taming, pet abilities, auto-harvest / guard.
// =============================================================================
title: TalkToStable
---
<<if $q_stable_stage == 0>>
    Fenn: A beast'll follow a kind hand further than gold ever could. Mine all ran off when the Heart dimmed.
    -> Teach me to tame one.
        Fenn: Tame one of the wild ones out past the gate and I'll teach you to fight beside it.
        <<set $q_stable_stage = 1>>
        <<StartQuest vendor.stable>>
        Fenn: "Wild Hearts." Go gentle — a frightened beast bites the hand that grabs.
    -> Just visit the stables.
        <<OpenShop "stable">>
        <<stop>>
<<elseif $q_stable_stage == 1>>
    Fenn: Did you tame one of the wild ones?
    -> It follows me now.
        <<AdvanceQuest vendor.stable>>
        <<set $q_stable_stage = 2>>
        Fenn: <i>He grins.</i> Look at that bond. Now let's train it an ability — I'll teach the guard stance that swats arrows from the sky. Stand it beside me.
    -> Not yet.
        Fenn: Patience tames more than rope ever did.
<<elseif $q_stable_stage == 2>>
    Fenn: Has the beast learned its ability?
    -> It's trained.
        <<AdvanceQuest vendor.stable>>
        <<set $q_stable_stage = 3>>
        Fenn: Now put it to honest work — send it to auto-harvest a node, or set it to guard an outpost. A bonded beast earns its feed.
    -> Not yet.
        Fenn: A beast learns by the doing. Keep at it.
<<elseif $q_stable_stage == 3>>
    Fenn: Is your beast working a node or guarding an outpost?
    -> It's earning its keep.
        <<AdvanceQuest vendor.stable>>
        <<GiveKeystone "BondedBeast">>
        <<set $q_stable_stage = 9>>
        Fenn: Then take the Bonded Beast token, and an extra stall besides — you've room for another now. The wilds are coming back to us, one kind hand at a time.
    -> Not yet.
        Fenn: Idle beasts fret. Give it a purpose.
<<else>>
    <<set $q_wildhearts_open = 1>>
    Fenn: The Bonded one returns. The pack's yours to command. What'll you have?
    -> Tell me about the wild ones. <<if $q_wildhearts_open == 1>>
        <<detour WildHearts>>
    -> Manage my pets.
        <<OpenShop "stable">>
        <<stop>>
    -> Upgrade the stables.
        <<OpenUpgrade "stable">>
        <<stop>>
    -> Nothing today.
        Fenn: Go on, they'll follow.
<<endif>>
===
